# DSN aus Sentry-Projekt > Settings > Client Keys (DSN).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=""
# Auth-Token nur im Build-Umfeld (Vercel) — für Source-Map-Upload. Sentry > Settings > Auth Tokens.
